{"id":"n58151-1-8","stage":1,"title":"남학생 · 男学生","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58151-1-8-1","ko":"이 많은 책상을 어떻게 옮기지?","zh":"这么多书桌要怎么搬呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책상을","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옮기지?","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3b3934f71c80a6a6036.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58151-1-8-2","ko":"옆 반에서 남학생을 몇 명 더 불러오자.","zh":"从隔壁班再叫几名男生过来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반에서","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남학생을","meaning":"男学生，男生","explanation":"남학생：男学生，男生；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"남학생","audio":"/audio/d3450a90b623acaacb0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58151","senseId":"1","lemma":"남학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불러오자.","meaning":"叫来","explanation":"불러오다：叫来；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"불러오다","audio":"/audio/b760d77b885bbe27fb46.mp3"}],"sources":[{